# Program Capacity & Invoice Reservation — worked examples.
#
# Run top to bottom against `docker compose up` + `npm run seed`. Every request
# after the first reuses the token the first one mints.
#
# VS Code: the REST Client extension. JetBrains: built in.

@host = http://localhost:3000
@api = {{host}}/api/v1

### 1. Mint a token (development only — this route 404s in production)
# @name token
POST {{api}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "analyst-1",
  "org": "org-northwind",
  "scope": "capacity:write programs:admin"
}

@bearer = {{token.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. The seeded program with head-room: 10,000,000.00 USD, 250,000.00 held
GET {{api}}/programs/prog-usd-northwind/capacity
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}

### 3. Reserve an invoice — 201
POST {{api}}/programs/prog-usd-northwind/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-reserve-1

{
  "invoiceId": "inv-demo-0001",
  "amount": "1800000.00",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 4. The same request again — 200, the same reservation, no second hold
POST {{api}}/programs/prog-usd-northwind/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "inv-demo-0001",
  "amount": "1800000.00",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 5. The same invoice for a different amount — 409 DUPLICATE_INVOICE
POST {{api}}/programs/prog-usd-northwind/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "inv-demo-0001",
  "amount": "1900000.00",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 6. More than the limit can hold — 409 INSUFFICIENT_CAPACITY
# prog-usd-tightrope is seeded with 1,000.00 left of 5,000,000.00.
POST {{api}}/programs/prog-usd-tightrope/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "inv-demo-0002",
  "amount": "50000.00",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 7. A token for the other seeded organisation
# prog-eur-hanseatic belongs to org-hanseatic, so it needs its own token —
# org-northwind’s would get a 404 (see 14).
# @name hanseatic
POST {{api}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sub": "analyst-h", "org": "org-hanseatic", "scope": "capacity:write" }

@hanseaticBearer = {{hanseatic.response.body.accessToken}}

### 8. An invoice in a currency the program does not hold, with a seeded rate
# prog-eur-hanseatic is EUR; USD→EUR is seeded, so this converts and stores
# the rate that priced it.
POST {{api}}/programs/prog-eur-hanseatic/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{hanseaticBearer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "inv-demo-0003",
  "amount": "100000.00",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 9. A currency with no quoted pair — 422 FX_RATE_NOT_FOUND
POST {{api}}/programs/prog-eur-hanseatic/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{hanseaticBearer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "inv-demo-0004",
  "amount": "100000.00",
  "currency": "GBP"
}

### 10. Release it — always 200, and idempotent (send it twice)
POST {{api}}/programs/prog-usd-northwind/reservations/inv-demo-0001/release
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "REPAID"
}

### 11. Capacity again — the release is reflected
GET {{api}}/programs/prog-usd-northwind/capacity
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}

### 12. The reservations, newest page first
GET {{api}}/programs/prog-usd-northwind/reservations?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}

### 13. The audit log — every change, and why
GET {{api}}/programs/prog-usd-northwind/events?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}

### 14. Another organisation's program — 404, not 403
# The same status and body as a program that does not exist: the API does not
# disclose which it was.
# @name otherOrg
POST {{api}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sub": "analyst-2", "org": "org-somebody-else", "scope": "capacity:write" }

###
GET {{api}}/programs/prog-usd-northwind/capacity
Authorization: Bearer {{otherOrg.response.body.accessToken}}

### 15. No token at all — 401
GET {{api}}/programs/prog-usd-northwind/capacity

### 16. The live stream. Reserve something in another tab and watch it arrive.
GET {{api}}/programs/prog-usd-northwind/capacity/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### 17. Probes and metrics — no token, outside /api/v1
GET {{host}}/health

###
GET {{host}}/health/ready

###
GET {{host}}/metrics
